cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. Please also cite the
  third-party datasets, simulators and algorithms listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
title: "RoboForge: Learning Robotic Manipulation Through Diffusion"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Holt
    given-names: Zackary
version: 0.0.1
repository-code: "https://github.com/zackholt05-tech/roboforge"
abstract: >-
  A controlled empirical comparison of behavior-cloning and conditional diffusion
  action policies for simulated 3D robotic manipulation (robosuite + MuJoCo,
  robomimic proficient-human demonstrations). Development in progress; no results yet.
keywords:
  - imitation learning
  - diffusion policy
  - robot manipulation
  - robosuite
  - MuJoCo
